@baseUrl = http://localhost:4004/sample
@dummyAuth = Basic ZHVtbXk6ZHVtbXk=
@ownerId = 81ffd7bc-8523-4d8e-8e27-db44959b2bea
@petId = fe51eaee-f4b0-4552-9091-059ad5b769b0

### Listar todos os pets (verificar campo age calculado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/Pets
Authorization: {{dummyAuth}}

### Buscar pet por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/Pets(id={{petId}})
Authorization: {{dummyAuth}}

### Criar novo pet associado a um proprietário
POST {{baseUrl}}/Pets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{dummyAuth}}

{
  "name": "Rex",
  "species": "Dog",
  "breed": "Dachshund",
  "birthDate": "2022-06-15",
  "weight": 12.5,
  "owner_id": "{{ownerId}}"
}

### Listar pets com proprietário expandido
GET {{baseUrl}}/Pets?$expand=owner
Authorization: {{dummyAuth}}

### Filtrar pets por espécie (Dog)
GET {{baseUrl}}/Pets?$filter=species eq 'Dog'
Authorization: {{dummyAuth}}

### Filtrar pets por espécie (Cat)
GET {{baseUrl}}/Pets?$filter=species eq 'Cat'
Authorization: {{dummyAuth}}